### 3. In-App Purchase Analysis
```python
# Load mobile game IAP data
iap_data = pd.read_csv('/content/datasets/mobile_game_inapp_purchases.csv')

# Price point analysis
price_distribution = iap_data['price'].hist(bins=50)
plt.title('IAP Price Distribution')
plt.xlabel('Price (USD)')
plt.ylabel('Frequency')
